          "text": "Témoignages: PIAN-MEDOC (LE) (33) 06.09.2013",
          "text_sha256": "8817d8e0b56bc19f4b10e14f8e527996c3a6e8482499ab3a7deb5877acebdab7"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
